@startuml UC-09
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-09.md
title UC-09: Update Profile
footer Feature PROF-02 | Business rules: BR-08
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "ProfileController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ProfileService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
participant "IStorageService" as STORE <<Daisy.Infrastructure>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Submit profile form (+ optional avatar file)
MVC -> API : PUT /api/profile (multipart/form-data)
API -> SVC : UpdateProfileAsync(currentUserId, request)
SVC -> SVC : Validate fields and avatar type/size
alt invalid input or unsupported avatar
  SVC --> API : ValidationException
  API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request (errors)
  MVC --> U : Show errors
else valid
  opt new avatar uploaded
    SVC -> STORE : SaveAsync(avatarFile)
    STORE --> SVC : avatarUrl
  end
  SVC -> DB : Update FullName, Phone, Gender, DateOfBirth,\nAvatarUrl, UpdatedAt of current user\nSaveChangesAsync
  note right of SVC : Email is not editable (BR-01)
  SVC --> API : ProfileDto
  API --> MVC : 200 OK
  MVC --> U : Show updated profile
end

@enduml
